## What this skill never does

- Edits source files (all agents are read-only during scouting).
- Commits or pushes anything.
- Creates Linear tickets (that is `/ss-run`'s job).
- Hardcodes project-specific values — everything comes from the brief.
- Auto-accepts uncertain haiku verdicts — uncertain cases always go to orchestrator review.
